ice 不同。\nattention_mode：注意力计算后端\n\nsdpa: PyTorch scaled_dot_product_attention（默认值，稳定，始终可用）\nflash_attnFlash Attention 2（在支持的硬件上速度更快，需要 flash-attn 软件包）\ntorch_compile_args：连接到 SeedVR2 Torch 编译设置节点，可提升 20-40% 的速度。\n"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "Note", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#335533", "size": [495.0076599121094, 850.5523071289062], "pos": [5453.056640625, 1015.1537475585938], "id": 21, "properties": {"ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}, "version": "7.5.2"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 5}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "image", "links": [46, 50], "label": "image", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image"}], "size": [270, 58], "pos": [5085.1103515625, 1520.550537109375], "widgets_values": [90], "inputs": [{"name": "image", "link": 48, "label": "image", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image"}, {"widget": {"name": "quality"}, "name": "quality", "label": "quality", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "quality"}], "flags": {}, "id": 42, "type": "KOOK_ImageCompression", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "KOOK_ImageCompression"}, "order": 35}, {"outputs": [{"name": "image_urls", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "image_urls"}], "color": "#247084", "widgets_values": ["ComfyUI"], "inputs": [{"name": "images", "link": 50, "label": "图像", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "图片"}, {"widget": {"name": "filename_prefix"}, "name": "filename_prefix", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "文件名前缀"}], "flags": {}, "type": "SaveImage", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#105c70", "size": [477.87066650390625, 711.3472290039062], "pos": [4761.64208984375, 200.5570068359375], "id": 44, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "SaveImage"}, "order": 37}, {"outputs": [{"name": "image_urls", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "image_urls"}], "color": "#247084", "widgets_values": ["ComfyUI"], "inputs": [{"name": "images", "link": 49, "label": "图像", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "图片"}